2bca53e3-1600-4f0f-90c7-08f48cf3dacb	9toFAbgA0bnYBBTOnFuW5b5yIHTdsrbT	hindsight	get_memory	Get a specific memory by ID.\n\nReturns the full memory unit including content, metadata, and timestamps.	{"type": "object", "required": ["memory_id"], "properties": {"memory_id": {"type": "string", "description": "The ID of the memory to retrieve"}}, "additionalProperties": false}	2026-06-11 12:21:46.132+08
8b105e48-3278-42b0-8edb-a2fd499e6c5e	9toFAbgA0bnYBBTOnFuW5b5yIHTdsrbT	hindsight	retain	Store important information to long-term memory.\n\nUse this tool PROACTIVELY whenever the user shares:\n- Personal facts, preferences, or interests\n- Important events or milestones\n- User history, experiences, or background\n- Decisions, opinions, or stated preferences\n- Goals, plans, or future intentions\n- Relationships or people mentioned\n- Work context, projects, or responsibilities	{"type": "object", "required": ["content"], "properties": {"tags": {"anyOf": [{"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null}, "content": {"type": "string"}, "context": {"type": "string", "default": "general"}, "metadata": {"anyOf": [{"type": "object", "additionalProperties": {"type": "string"}}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null}, "strategy": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null}, "timestamp": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null}, "document_id": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null}, "update_mode": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null}}, "additionalProperties": false}	2026-06-11 12:21:46.132+08
a2e97b51-fa9d-4529-a2ad-4be4ca98a7bf	9toFAbgA0bnYBBTOnFuW5b5yIHTdsrbT	hindsight	sync_retain	Store information to long-term memory and wait for completion.\n\nUnlike retain (which is asynchronous), this tool blocks until the memory\nis fully stored and immediately available for recall.	{"type": "object", "required": ["content"], "properties": {"tags": {"anyOf": [{"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "Optional tags for scoped visibility filtering (e.g., ['project:alpha', 'user:123'])"}, "content": {"type": "string", "description": "The fact/memory to store (be specific and include relevant details)"}, "context": {"type": "string", "default": "general", "description": "Category for the memory (e.g., 'preferences', 'work', 'hobbies', 'family'). Default: 'general'"}, "metadata": {"anyOf": [{"type": "object", "additionalProperties": {"type": "string"}}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "Optional key-value metadata to attach (e.g., {'source': 'slack', 'channel': 'general'})"}, "strategy": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "Optional named retain strategy (e.g., 'exact' for verbatim storage). Strategies are defined in the bank config."}, "timestamp": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "When this event/fact occurred (ISO format, e.g., '2024-01-15T10:30:00Z'). Useful for timeline tracking."}, "document_id": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "Optional document ID to associate this memory with"}}, "additionalProperties": false}	2026-06-11 12:21:46.132+08
985b09ce-ee4a-47d5-8200-e9f867a376a5	9toFAbgA0bnYBBTOnFuW5b5yIHTdsrbT	hindsight	recall	Search memories to provide personalized, context-aware responses.\n\nUse this tool PROACTIVELY to:\n- Check user's preferences before making suggestions\n- Recall user's history to provide continuity\n- Remember user's goals and context\n- Personalize responses based on past interactions	{"type": "object", "required": ["query"], "properties": {"tags": {"anyOf": [{"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null}, "query": {"type": "string"}, "types": {"anyOf": [{"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null}, "budget": {"type": "string", "default": "high"}, "max_tokens": {"type": "integer", "default": 4096}, "tag_groups": {"anyOf": [{"type": "array", "items": {"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true}}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null}, "tags_match": {"type": "string", "default": "any"}, "query_timestamp": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null}}, "additionalProperties": false}	2026-06-11 12:21:46.132+08
18234c35-5209-49b5-98df-659c07c0eb28	9toFAbgA0bnYBBTOnFuW5b5yIHTdsrbT	hindsight	reflect	Generate thoughtful analysis by synthesizing stored memories with the bank's personality.\n\nWHEN TO USE THIS TOOL:\nUse reflect when you need reasoned analysis, not just fact retrieval. This tool\nthinks through the question using everything the bank knows and its personality traits.\n\nEXAMPLES OF GOOD QUERIES:\n- "What patterns have emerged in how I approach debugging?"\n- "Based on my past decisions, what architectural style do I prefer?"\n- "What might be the best approach for this problem given what you know about me?"\n- "How should I prioritize these tasks based on my goals?"\n\nHOW IT DIFFERS FROM RECALL:\n- recall: Returns raw facts matching your search (fast lookup)\n- reflect: Reasons across memories to form a synthesized answer (deeper analysis)\n\nUse recall for "what did I say about X?" and reflect for "what should I do about X?"	{"type": "object", "required": ["query"], "properties": {"tags": {"anyOf": [{"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "Optional tags to filter memories by (e.g., ['project:alpha'])"}, "query": {"type": "string", "description": "The question or topic to reflect on"}, "budget": {"type": "string", "default": "low", "description": "Search budget - 'low', 'mid', or 'high' (default: 'low')"}, "context": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "Optional context about why this reflection is needed"}, "max_tokens": {"type": "integer", "default": 4096, "description": "Maximum tokens for the response (default: 4096)"}, "tags_match": {"type": "string", "default": "any", "description": "How to match tags - 'any' (match any tag) or 'all' (match all tags). Default: 'any'"}, "response_schema": {"anyOf": [{"type": "object", "additionalProperties": true}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "Optional JSON schema for structured output. When provided, the response includes a 'structured_output' field."}, "include_based_on": {"type": "boolean", "default": false, "description": "Include source facts used for synthesis. Defaults to false because broad reflections can exceed MCP client result limits."}}, "additionalProperties": false}	2026-06-11 12:21:46.132+08
78ae79a9-539d-4f0d-bc4f-53baefe539e8	9toFAbgA0bnYBBTOnFuW5b5yIHTdsrbT	hindsight	list_mental_models	List mental models (pinned reflections) for this memory bank.\n\nMental models are living documents that stay current by periodically re-running\na source query through reflect. Use them to maintain up-to-date summaries,\npreferences, or synthesized knowledge.	{"type": "object", "properties": {"tags": {"anyOf": [{"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "Optional tags to filter by (returns models matching any tag)"}, "detail": {"type": "string", "default": "full", "description": "Detail level - 'metadata' (names/tags only), 'content' (adds content/config), 'full' (includes reflect_response). Default: 'full'"}}, "additionalProperties": false}	2026-06-11 12:21:46.132+08
7086ce84-deed-4c21-b698-24454cf29765	9toFAbgA0bnYBBTOnFuW5b5yIHTdsrbT	hindsight	get_mental_model	Get a specific mental model by ID.\n\nReturns the mental model with the requested detail level. Use list_mental_models\nfirst to discover available model IDs.	{"type": "object", "required": ["mental_model_id"], "properties": {"detail": {"type": "string", "default": "full", "description": "Detail level - 'metadata' (names/tags only), 'content' (adds content/config), 'full' (includes reflect_response). Default: 'full'"}, "mental_model_id": {"type": "string", "description": "The ID of the mental model to retrieve"}}, "additionalProperties": false}	2026-06-11 12:21:46.132+08
d2011f06-2bda-4335-845d-ce8c5fee5585	9toFAbgA0bnYBBTOnFuW5b5yIHTdsrbT	hindsight	create_mental_model	Create a new mental model (pinned reflection).\n\nA mental model is a living document generated by running the source_query through\nreflect. The content is auto-generated asynchronously - use the returned operation_id\nto track progress.\n\nEXAMPLES:\n- name="Coding Preferences", source_query="What coding patterns and tools does the user prefer?"\n- name="Project Goals", source_query="What are the user's current project goals and priorities?"\n- name="Communication Style", source_query="How does the user prefer to communicate?"	{"type": "object", "required": ["name", "source_query"], "properties": {"name": {"type": "string", "description": "Human-readable name for the mental model"}, "tags": {"anyOf": [{"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "Optional tags for scoped visibility filtering"}, "max_tokens": {"type": "integer", "default": 2048, "description": "Maximum tokens for generated content (256-8192, default: 2048)"}, "source_query": {"type": "string", "description": "The query to run through reflect to generate content"}, "mental_model_id": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "Optional custom ID (alphanumeric lowercase with hyphens). Auto-generated if not provided."}, "trigger_refresh_after_consolidation": {"type": "boolean", "default": false, "description": "If True, automatically refresh this model after memory consolidation. Default: False"}}, "additionalProperties": false}	2026-06-11 12:21:46.132+08
29d3a8b7-6160-4c3b-82df-356ce9c6110f	9toFAbgA0bnYBBTOnFuW5b5yIHTdsrbT	hindsight	update_mental_model	Update a mental model's metadata.\n\nChanges the name, source query, or tags of an existing mental model.\nTo regenerate the content, use refresh_mental_model after updating the source query.	{"type": "object", "required": ["mental_model_id"], "properties": {"name": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "New name (leave None to keep current)"}, "tags": {"anyOf": [{"type": "array", "items": {"type": "string"}}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "New tags (leave None to keep current)"}, "max_tokens": {"anyOf": [{"type": "integer"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "New max tokens for content generation (256-8192, leave None to keep current)"}, "source_query": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "New source query (leave None to keep current)"}, "mental_model_id": {"type": "string", "description": "The ID of the mental model to update"}, "trigger_refresh_after_consolidation": {"anyOf": [{"type": "boolean"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "If set, update whether this model auto-refreshes after consolidation"}}, "additionalProperties": false}	2026-06-11 12:21:46.132+08
